<title>USA: Tampa Authority $30 mln repriced, yields raised.</title>
<headline>Tampa Authority $30 mln repriced, yields raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc. said Tuesday it repriced Tampa Sports Authority's $29.5 million stadium project, raising yields in several maturities and lifting the top yield in 2027 to 5.56 percent from 5.535 percent.</p>
